; Method pointers and slice: what is rejected.
; RUN: not %p3 --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 --emit-ast %S/Inputs/methodpointers/errors.pas 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: errors.pas:32:5: error: assigning to 'TE' from incompatible type 'procedure(integer)'
; CHECK: errors.pas:33:5: error: assigning to 'TP' from incompatible type 'procedure(integer) of object'
; CHECK: errors.pas:34:5: error: assigning to 'TL' from incompatible type 'procedure(integer) of object'
; CHECK: errors.pas:35:5: error: assigning to 'TF' from incompatible type 'procedure(integer) of object'
; CHECK: errors.pas:36:5: error: assigning to 'TE' from incompatible type 'pointer'
; CHECK: errors.pas:37:11: error: '@Make': constructors and destructors cannot be method pointers
; CHECK: errors.pas:38:11: error: '@Free': the methods of TObject cannot be method pointers
; CHECK: errors.pas:39:5: error: assigning to 'TE' from incompatible type 'TA'
; CHECK: errors.pas:40:10: error: procedure 'p' does not return a value
; CHECK: errors.pas:41:8: error: invalid operands to '=' ('TE' and 'integer')
; CHECK: errors.pas:42:7: error: cannot pass a value of type 'procedure(integer)' to parameter 'e' of type 'TE'
; CHECK: errors.pas:43:13: error: argument for 'var' parameter 'v' must be a variable
; CHECK: errors.pas:44:11: error: '@O': 'O' is overloaded; assign it to a method pointer of the heading wanted
; CHECK: errors.pas:45:8: error: cannot pass a value of type 'array of byte' to parameter 'a' of type 'array of integer'
; CHECK: errors.pas:46:14: error: 'slice' expects an array, not 'integer'
; CHECK: errors.pas:47:8: error: 'slice' expects 2 arguments
; CHECK: errors.pas:48:19: error: expected an integer
; CHECK: errors.pas:49:15: error: 'slice' can only be passed to an open array parameter
; CHECK-NOT: error:
